From 754fbd585cc4270bbd36ec4b8bb2e6104a8101bf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JeyKul <jey@kulovac.de>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 21:52:32 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 27/56] WIP: drm/amdgpu: probe the Samsung Xclipse 920

Explicit 1002:163F entry (CHIP_VANGOGH | AMD_IS_APU) when the Exynos 2200
PCI shim is built, hardcoded register bases instead of IP discovery.
For now: read GRBM_CHIP_REVISION and stop.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
